@@ -344,6 +344,16 @@
   Candidate reservations, M/heap state transitions and the final publication
   checks remain active. Deferred, pinned, full-page-waiting and payload-buffered
   modes retain their member dependency index and bucket bookkeeping.
+- Immediate private seed-prefetch preparation reuses complete resident records
+  acquired during candidate qualification when assembling the final page.
+  The refresh-local snapshot holds at most one page of record bytes; it is not
+  another persistent cache. W/fetched-member eligibility, D fallback for
+  uncaptured qualification members, graph packing order, publication checks
+  and asynchronous eviction writeback are retained. Owned records remain valid
+  if their N slots are reused before publication. Set
+  `NEIGHBORCACHE_PREFETCH_MERGE_PREPARE=0` to use the previous separate path.
+  Shared prefetch, delayed/buffered/pinned modes and multi-page mode retain the
+  previous preparation path.
